(5579854, 808211, 83313, '<td valign="top">I hit the 5 key and moved on, then came back because I felt obligated to explain my vote. This is a good shot of what I assume is your kids. Nothing stands out to grab a stranger about this shot, but it is good nonetheless. A nice one to hang on the wall, so that you know what your kids look like when they are not fighting with each other.</td>', 'I hit the 5 key and moved on, then came back because I felt obligated to explain my vote. This is a good shot of what I assume is your kids. Nothing stands out to grab a stranger about this shot, but it is good nonetheless. A nice one to hang on the wall, so that you know what your kids look like when they are not fighting with each other.', '2009-07-20 01:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
