(5581079, 808204, 54228, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this makes it a really worthwhile portrait. She looks like a lovely girl!</td>', 'The simplicity of this makes it a really worthwhile portrait. She looks like a lovely girl!', '2009-07-20 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581083, 808095, 54228, '<td valign="top">You really did a great job with your depth of field here, and getting that light on what seems like a very flat day!</td>', 'You really did a great job with your depth of field here, and getting that light on what seems like a very flat day!', '2009-07-20 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581085, 808253, 54228, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. I would like a little more separation off the black background.</td>', 'Great portrait. I would like a little more separation off the black background.', '2009-07-20 22:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581088, 808286, 54228, '<td valign="top">Great work on lighting him, and the chrome!</td>', 'Great work on lighting him, and the chrome!', '2009-07-20 22:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581090, 807992, 54228, '<td valign="top">A great idea, and fairly well executed, it just feels very tense to me.</td>', 'A great idea, and fairly well executed, it just feels very tense to me.', '2009-07-20 22:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581093, 807536, 54228, '<td valign="top">That lipstick really stands out! I wish we had a little more shape to the light here.</td>', 'That lipstick really stands out! I wish we had a little more shape to the light here.', '2009-07-20 22:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581096, 808248, 54228, '<td valign="top">Fantastic pose, and a wonderful model. I feel like this might have been better with some light from the back and just a fill from the front to give more depth.</td>', 'Fantastic pose, and a wonderful model. I feel like this might have been better with some light from the back and just a fill from the front to give more depth.', '2009-07-20 22:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581166, 808186, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the DOF worked well here. It looks like it may have been intentional but it still hurts the photo.</td>', 'I don''t think the DOF worked well here. It looks like it may have been intentional but it still hurts the photo.', '2009-07-20 23:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581173, 808063, 77724, '<td valign="top">offbeeat, fun, I like it</td>', 'offbeeat, fun, I like it', '2009-07-20 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581174, 808063, 102019, '<td valign="top">This is the first of the photos that I''ve looked at so far in this challenge that I actually like.  I love the lighting and the angle of the shot.  My only criticism would be the blue blob in the top left corner -- I don''t think it adds anything to the effect of this photo and it is a bit distracting.</td>', 'This is the first of the photos that I''ve looked at so far in this challenge that I actually like.  I love the lighting and the angle of the shot.  My only criticism would be the blue blob in the top left corner -- I don''t think it adds anything to the effect of this photo and it is a bit distracting.', '2009-07-20 23:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581176, 808227, 101492, '<td valign="top">The eyes really pierce the soul in this one, they become the focal point</td>', 'The eyes really pierce the soul in this one, they become the focal point', '2009-07-20 23:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581179, 807816, 101492, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus doesn''t enhance this for me.</td>', 'The lack of focus doesn''t enhance this for me.', '2009-07-20 23:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581180, 807941, 101492, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and perspective, lighting is good, but I am bothered by her eyes, almost makes her look murdered</td>', 'I like the pose and perspective, lighting is good, but I am bothered by her eyes, almost makes her look murdered', '2009-07-20 23:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581182, 808265, 101492, '<td valign="top">What a pretty model, better keep her away from the model in old soul!</td>', 'What a pretty model, better keep her away from the model in old soul!', '2009-07-20 23:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581184, 808123, 101492, '<td valign="top">The perspective with the sky here almost looks like a storm is ocming which kind of adds an ominous sense to what should be a joyous occasion.  Interesting idea though</td>', 'The perspective with the sky here almost looks like a storm is ocming which kind of adds an ominous sense to what should be a joyous occasion.  Interesting idea though', '2009-07-20 23:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581185, 807885, 101492, '<td valign="top">Would be a good photojournalism shot, doesn''t work quite as well as a portrait.</td>', 'Would be a good photojournalism shot, doesn''t work quite as well as a portrait.', '2009-07-20 23:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581187, 807625, 101492, '<td valign="top">I like that you tried something different, but the streaks on her face are distracting and sort of extraterrestrial.  I love the lighting and the background color, even the pose.</td>', 'I like that you tried something different, but the streaks on her face are distracting and sort of extraterrestrial.  I love the lighting and the background color, even the pose.', '2009-07-20 23:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581189, 808124, 101492, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the lighting, don''t like the fingers on his face</td>', 'Love the angle and the lighting, don''t like the fingers on his face', '2009-07-20 23:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581191, 807655, 101492, '<td valign="top">straightforward, classic, very nice</td>', 'straightforward, classic, very nice', '2009-07-20 23:57:44.000000', NULL, 1);
