(5581198, 808104, 101492, '<td valign="top">This angle draws a little too much attention to her cleavage--unless that was the plan--in which case it is perfect!  lol  Great color, like the lighting, her eyes really pop</td>', 'This angle draws a little too much attention to her cleavage--unless that was the plan--in which case it is perfect!  lol  Great color, like the lighting, her eyes really pop', '2009-07-21 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
