(5581249, 807887, 101492, '<td valign="top">The shadow cuts his face in half, I had the same problem while photographing my son in his cowboy hat for this challenge.  The eyes are striking, especially against the blue in his shirt.</td>', 'The shadow cuts his face in half, I had the same problem while photographing my son in his cowboy hat for this challenge.  The eyes are striking, especially against the blue in his shirt.', '2009-07-21 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581253, 808294, 101492, '<td valign="top">I find the fans gimmicky.  This would be a great shot cropped a little more tightly with the fans removed.  The wood has a warmth that really enhances the subject, the piano suggests something about his personality or interests, and his pose and expression are great.  I think the fans kill the shot.</td>', 'I find the fans gimmicky.  This would be a great shot cropped a little more tightly with the fans removed.  The wood has a warmth that really enhances the subject, the piano suggests something about his personality or interests, and his pose and expression are great.  I think the fans kill the shot.', '2009-07-21 00:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581260, 808290, 101492, '<td valign="top">I love how the lighting kind of shimmers or glows on his skin, very cool earthy shot</td>', 'I love how the lighting kind of shimmers or glows on his skin, very cool earthy shot', '2009-07-21 00:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581286, 808180, 70514, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, the high key, the relaxed expression.  Gorgeous.</td>', 'Love the composition, the high key, the relaxed expression.  Gorgeous.', '2009-07-21 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581288, 808134, 70514, '<td valign="top">A very unexpected image, which is quite interesting.  Great focus on the eyes, but the tool box throws me off :)  Nonetheless, interesting.</td>', 'A very unexpected image, which is quite interesting.  Great focus on the eyes, but the tool box throws me off :)  Nonetheless, interesting.', '2009-07-21 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581315, 808211, 91783, '<td valign="top">their eyes are absolutly amazing!!</td>', 'their eyes are absolutly amazing!!', '2009-07-21 02:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581319, 808067, 91783, '<td valign="top">i really would have liked to see more of the whole head, and i really dont care for the selective desat. <br/>the thing i do like is the clarity of yhr face.</td>', 'i really would have liked to see more of the whole head, and i really dont care for the selective desat. the thing i do like is the clarity of yhr face.', '2009-07-21 02:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581321, 808048, 73056, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful subject. He oozes interesting character. Fabulous processing.</td>', 'What a wonderful subject. He oozes interesting character. Fabulous processing.', '2009-07-21 02:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581323, 808058, 91783, '<td valign="top">the face is over edited, personally. especially the eyes. i think that if you hadn''t done that then the picture would have been better.</td>', 'the face is over edited, personally. especially the eyes. i think that if you hadn''t done that then the picture would have been better.', '2009-07-21 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581325, 808123, 73056, '<td valign="top">So well shot and processed! The wide angle is great with this.</td>', 'So well shot and processed! The wide angle is great with this.', '2009-07-21 02:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581327, 807929, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice environmental portrait and conversion, but it looks slightly out of focus - maybe suffering from alittle camera shake.</td>', 'Nice environmental portrait and conversion, but it looks slightly out of focus - maybe suffering from alittle camera shake.', '2009-07-21 02:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581329, 808201, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice and dramatic. Great lighting and tones.</td>', 'Nice and dramatic. Great lighting and tones.', '2009-07-21 02:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581330, 807697, 73056, '<td valign="top">Cool processing. Nicely done.</td>', 'Cool processing. Nicely done.', '2009-07-21 02:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581331, 807178, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and beautiful clarity.</td>', 'Great lighting and beautiful clarity.', '2009-07-21 02:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581332, 808290, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great model! Love the angle, lighting and processing.</td>', 'Great model! Love the angle, lighting and processing.', '2009-07-21 02:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581335, 807646, 73056, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! Beautiful angle - great play with baby blues here.</td>', 'Lovely shot! Beautiful angle - great play with baby blues here.', '2009-07-21 02:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581336, 807765, 73056, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2009-07-21 02:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581337, 807974, 45475, '<td valign="top">lmao!!!!!1 ....ohmygodohmygodohmygod.... can''t... breathe....</td>', 'lmao!!!!!1 ....ohmygodohmygodohmygod.... can''t... breathe....', '2009-07-21 02:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581377, 807929, 54645, '<td valign="top">What a classic. Excellent tone. Pose and gaze is great, exotropia is an added bonus.  Halo along the left neck/face/ear was missed, but overall a favorite of mine in the challenge. 8</td>', 'What a classic. Excellent tone. Pose and gaze is great, exotropia is an added bonus.  Halo along the left neck/face/ear was missed, but overall a favorite of mine in the challenge. 8', '2009-07-21 04:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581378, 808180, 54645, '<td valign="top">Outstanding work Kari, in particular with the high key and contrast</td>', 'Outstanding work Kari, in particular with the high key and contrast', '2009-07-21 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581379, 808072, 54645, '<td valign="top">Very interesting face and adornments. I''m looking forward to the details.</td>', 'Very interesting face and adornments. I''m looking forward to the details.', '2009-07-21 04:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581383, 807643, 63812, '<td valign="top">very good composition and lights. well done!</td>', 'very good composition and lights. well done!', '2009-07-21 04:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
