(5581395, 807875, 63812, '<td valign="top">Amazing!  this crop,and colors and texture are excellent! I anxiously wait to know how you processed this image. I can feel he is breathing in my face. Superb portrait!</td>', 'Amazing!  this crop,and colors and texture are excellent! I anxiously wait to know how you processed this image. I can feel he is breathing in my face. Superb portrait!', '2009-07-21 04:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581396, 807651, 63812, '<td valign="top">nice portrait. Great lights and composition. 8</td>', 'nice portrait. Great lights and composition. 8', '2009-07-21 04:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581397, 807974, 63812, '<td valign="top">OMG! from what hell is this face coming?  Funny and nicely done. 9</td>', 'OMG! from what hell is this face coming?  Funny and nicely done. 9', '2009-07-21 05:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581402, 807655, 63812, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait</td>', 'beautiful portrait', '2009-07-21 05:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581427, 808303, 46679, '<td valign="top">I really like your approach! It''s fresh, youthful, out of the box.</td>', 'I really like your approach! It''s fresh, youthful, out of the box.', '2009-07-21 07:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581428, 808322, 46679, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but too much photoshopping going on for my taste.</td>', 'Nice idea, but too much photoshopping going on for my taste.', '2009-07-21 07:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581431, 808092, 46679, '<td valign="top">This being a set up, I would have asked one of the two players to dress in a different uniform and helmet for added effect. That being said, I think it''s a very good idea and nicely executed.</td>', 'This being a set up, I would have asked one of the two players to dress in a different uniform and helmet for added effect. That being said, I think it''s a very good idea and nicely executed.', '2009-07-21 07:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581434, 807857, 46679, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed! Very good post processing and perfectly captured. Not like most portraits and that''s what attracts me to it.</td>', 'Very nice indeed! Very good post processing and perfectly captured. Not like most portraits and that''s what attracts me to it.', '2009-07-21 07:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581437, 807988, 46679, '<td valign="top">Good idea. However, in my opinion, photography is more than capture and post-processing. I don''t like the shoes and socks. T-shirt should be more graphic for this sort of thing.</td>', 'Good idea. However, in my opinion, photography is more than capture and post-processing. I don''t like the shoes and socks. T-shirt should be more graphic for this sort of thing.', '2009-07-21 07:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581441, 808315, 46679, '<td valign="top">Well done.  A lot of personality in this face and posture. Black and white processing does it justice.</td>', 'Well done.  A lot of personality in this face and posture. Black and white processing does it justice.', '2009-07-21 07:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581468, 808048, 56828, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is great.  Good lighting, composition and DOF.  Your border is distracting and slightly hurting the photo.</td>', 'The photo itself is great.  Good lighting, composition and DOF.  Your border is distracting and slightly hurting the photo.', '2009-07-21 08:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581469, 807807, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, to me this says "<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83845" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cynthiann</a>" because of the whole "blow bubbles instead of smoking" thing.  And it is a way cool photo - I quite like it!</td>', 'OK, to me this says " cynthiann" because of the whole "blow bubbles instead of smoking" thing.  And it is a way cool photo - I quite like it!', '2009-07-21 08:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581470, 808127, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very fun - makes me smile!  (Color tones are a bit off on the older gentleman''s arms and the shaded side of his face - I suspect perhaps the use of shadows/highlights or something similar which often messes with color tones.)</td>', 'Very fun - makes me smile!  (Color tones are a bit off on the older gentleman''s arms and the shaded side of his face - I suspect perhaps the use of shadows/highlights or something similar which often messes with color tones.)', '2009-07-21 08:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581471, 808179, 30982, '<td valign="top">While some may tell you this is a "snapshot", it works as a portrait for me.  I like the flickr button!  (We need a DPC button...)</td>', 'While some may tell you this is a "snapshot", it works as a portrait for me.  I like the flickr button!  (We need a DPC button...)', '2009-07-21 08:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581472, 808172, 56828, '<td valign="top">Everything is out of focus.  Not sure if you attempted a soft focus, but aside from the eyes everything looks blurry, which makes her eyes look a little off.   My eyes are also being pulled to the over exposed area between the frame caused by her arm.  I think your model is great, you have nice lighting (aside from the over exposure).</td>', 'Everything is out of focus.  Not sure if you attempted a soft focus, but aside from the eyes everything looks blurry, which makes her eyes look a little off.   My eyes are also being pulled to the over exposed area between the frame caused by her arm.  I think your model is great, you have nice lighting (aside from the over exposure).', '2009-07-21 08:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581473, 808123, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great portrait - very good lighting on the wedding party and an excellent background!</td>', 'Great portrait - very good lighting on the wedding party and an excellent background!', '2009-07-21 08:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581476, 808320, 56828, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, pose, and composition.  My only complaint would be that your models facial expression looks as if she smelled something foul.</td>', 'I love the lighting, pose, and composition.  My only complaint would be that your models facial expression looks as if she smelled something foul.', '2009-07-21 08:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
