(5583773, 808286, 78021, '<td valign="top">Great lighting! (Nice bike too!)</td>', 'Great lighting! (Nice bike too!)', '2009-07-23 01:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583786, 808067, 42495, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential and I like the lighting and selective desat, but seems a bit oversharpened on my monitor.</td>', 'Lots of potential and I like the lighting and selective desat, but seems a bit oversharpened on my monitor.', '2009-07-23 01:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583788, 808063, 108833, '<td valign="top">Deep, contrasty image....nice.</td>', 'Deep, contrasty image....nice.', '2009-07-23 01:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583893, 808248, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is well done but I think the composition could have excluded the armpit which seems a little too prominent and detracts a little from what is otherwise a fine high-key image.</td>', 'This is well done but I think the composition could have excluded the armpit which seems a little too prominent and detracts a little from what is otherwise a fine high-key image.', '2009-07-23 06:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584019, 807857, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great image, stands out from the rest of the crowd - I wonder if the burn top left is a bit heavy (rules-wise) but I am a fan. 9.</td>', 'Great image, stands out from the rest of the crowd - I wonder if the burn top left is a bit heavy (rules-wise) but I am a fan. 9.', '2009-07-23 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584020, 808303, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love, love, love this!!</td>', 'I love, love, love this!!', '2009-07-23 11:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584021, 808290, 100393, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully executed in every way.</td>', 'Wonderfully executed in every way.', '2009-07-23 11:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584027, 807765, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great commitment in securing this image - excellent work.</td>', 'Great commitment in securing this image - excellent work.', '2009-07-23 11:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584042, 808262, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is kinda cool! Good use of a prop to show the real person. I like the unique way you''ve presented it. Nice job. 7</td>', 'This is kinda cool! Good use of a prop to show the real person. I like the unique way you''ve presented it. Nice job. 7', '2009-07-23 11:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584047, 807643, 19831, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Love the square crop. Great composition, very nice lighting. Nice catch lights. The pose really draws me in to the image. Only very minor nitpick, a few hotspots on lips. Really nice photo, great job.</td>', 'I really like this. Love the square crop. Great composition, very nice lighting. Nice catch lights. The pose really draws me in to the image. Only very minor nitpick, a few hotspots on lips. Really nice photo, great job.', '2009-07-23 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584052, 808208, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great environmental portrait. Having him centered works well for this image, IMO. Nice job.</td>', 'Great environmental portrait. Having him centered works well for this image, IMO. Nice job.', '2009-07-23 11:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584059, 807816, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very daring image for the dpc crowd. The half face framing seems a little cliche, but the softness and processing kind of offsets that for me. I like the tones throughout. For me, overall, gutsy and interesting, I like it. Nice job. Good luck with the rest of the voters! :-)</td>', 'Very daring image for the dpc crowd. The half face framing seems a little cliche, but the softness and processing kind of offsets that for me. I like the tones throughout. For me, overall, gutsy and interesting, I like it. Nice job. Good luck with the rest of the voters! :-)', '2009-07-23 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584061, 808095, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great job on the exposure. Good composition. Very nice image.</td>', 'Great job on the exposure. Good composition. Very nice image.', '2009-07-23 12:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584066, 808110, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good pose for this shot. Great lighting. Nice job.</td>', 'Good pose for this shot. Great lighting. Nice job.', '2009-07-23 12:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584074, 808180, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like this. Compositionally, I think you really got the pose, and framing just right, the negative space feels well balanced and adds to the shot. I like the high key look, and the facial expression works well here. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this. Compositionally, I think you really got the pose, and framing just right, the negative space feels well balanced and adds to the shot. I like the high key look, and the facial expression works well here. Nice job.', '2009-07-23 12:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584083, 808030, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept and great composition. IMO, either the lighting or perhaps pushing the processing, has made his body into a featureless, blobby blackness, and to me seems to take a lot away from the image. Also seems to be a lot of hotspots, especially around the forehead and top of the goggles. Totally awesome idea, with different lighting, this would probably be one of my favorites.</td>', 'Very cool concept and great composition. IMO, either the lighting or perhaps pushing the processing, has made his body into a featureless, blobby blackness, and to me seems to take a lot away from the image. Also seems to be a lot of hotspots, especially around the forehead and top of the goggles. Totally awesome idea, with different lighting, this would probably be one of my favorites.', '2009-07-23 12:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584090, 808217, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I really like the wide angle. Great pose and expression. Really good detail. Nice work!</td>', 'Very cool shot. I really like the wide angle. Great pose and expression. Really good detail. Nice work!', '2009-07-23 12:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584098, 808240, 19831, '<td valign="top">Looks very candid. Makes for a great environmental portrait. His expression/posture really says "On the job!" It looks like there may be a little haloing going on, maybe some slight oversharpening? Overall, a nice shot though. Good job.</td>', 'Looks very candid. Makes for a great environmental portrait. His expression/posture really says "On the job!" It looks like there may be a little haloing going on, maybe some slight oversharpening? Overall, a nice shot though. Good job.', '2009-07-23 12:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584104, 807929, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great subject! Very striking image. The processing here works really well for the image, IMO. Nice job!</td>', 'Great subject! Very striking image. The processing here works really well for the image, IMO. Nice job!', '2009-07-23 12:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584107, 808186, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very daring submission for dpc :-) I really like it though. I think it works very well for this image, for this person. I think it helps in showing who this guy is, which after all, is the goal of a good portrait, no? Good job with the lighting too. So, nice job! Good luck with the rest of the voters. :-)</td>', 'Very daring submission for dpc :-) I really like it though. I think it works very well for this image, for this person. I think it helps in showing who this guy is, which after all, is the goal of a good portrait, no? Good job with the lighting too. So, nice job! Good luck with the rest of the voters. :-)', '2009-07-23 12:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584110, 808182, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like it! Nice job.</td>', 'I like it! Nice job.', '2009-07-23 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584112, 808123, 54228, '<td valign="top">A nice formal. The noise is really showing through in the man''s trousers on the left, which is really bugging me here.</td>', 'A nice formal. The noise is really showing through in the man''s trousers on the left, which is really bugging me here.', '2009-07-23 12:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584115, 808253, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Interesting lighting and processing. I like it!</td>', 'Very cool. Interesting lighting and processing. I like it!', '2009-07-23 12:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584117, 807875, 54228, '<td valign="top">A great, tight portrait with some nice colours.</td>', 'A great, tight portrait with some nice colours.', '2009-07-23 12:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584119, 807663, 54228, '<td valign="top">This has quite a cinematic quality to it, like a stolen moment. The green of her shirt distracts me a little, and the lean is a little much for a still portrait.</td>', 'This has quite a cinematic quality to it, like a stolen moment. The green of her shirt distracts me a little, and the lean is a little much for a still portrait.', '2009-07-23 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584121, 807651, 54228, '<td valign="top">Shallow depth is really well used here, I''d like to know which lens this was.</td>', 'Shallow depth is really well used here, I''d like to know which lens this was.', '2009-07-23 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584125, 807954, 54228, '<td valign="top">This kind of reminds me of a graveyard, and the black dress a funeral... She''s lovely, and I''m sure your happy. I might have chosen a nicer location for my wife, and muse.</td>', 'This kind of reminds me of a graveyard, and the black dress a funeral... She''s lovely, and I''m sure your happy. I might have chosen a nicer location for my wife, and muse.', '2009-07-23 12:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584127, 808103, 54228, '<td valign="top">A nice, simple moment.</td>', 'A nice, simple moment.', '2009-07-23 12:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584129, 808048, 54228, '<td valign="top">The border here makes me feel like I''m looking through a viewfinder. Your editing really brings out the details in his face, but I feel like you''ve lost something of the original lighting because of it.</td>', 'The border here makes me feel like I''m looking through a viewfinder. Your editing really brings out the details in his face, but I feel like you''ve lost something of the original lighting because of it.', '2009-07-23 12:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584133, 807711, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great concept here. A nice environmental portrait. I really like the angle of the shot. To me, it seems like there could be a little more detail on his right side, seems to kind of lose his hair and beard in the black. I wouldn''t want to lose the feel of the image, but perhaps even a reflector down low on his right would add some detail? Overall a cool shot though. Nice work.</td>', 'Great concept here. A nice environmental portrait. I really like the angle of the shot. To me, it seems like there could be a little more detail on his right side, seems to kind of lose his hair and beard in the black. I wouldn''t want to lose the feel of the image, but perhaps even a reflector down low on his right would add some detail? Overall a cool shot though. Nice work.', '2009-07-23 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584134, 808208, 54228, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic location, wonderful toning, and perfect light. If only it were a tad sharper, this would be my pick for the challenge!</td>', 'This is a fantastic location, wonderful toning, and perfect light. If only it were a tad sharper, this would be my pick for the challenge!', '2009-07-23 12:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584137, 807974, 19831, '<td valign="top">hehehe :-) Very fitting processing. That thing going on with the hair looks a little devilish :-) Very amusing, and I quite like it. Nice job :-)</td>', 'hehehe :-) Very fitting processing. That thing going on with the hair looks a little devilish :-) Very amusing, and I quite like it. Nice job :-)', '2009-07-23 12:39:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5584142, 807992, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great subject! Very cool image. Great job on the lighting. I love the composition. The centered works great here. Highly interesting, a very compelling and stimulating image. Really cool hat, too :-) Great job.</td>', 'Great subject! Very cool image. Great job on the lighting. I love the composition. The centered works great here. Highly interesting, a very compelling and stimulating image. Really cool hat, too :-) Great job.', '2009-07-23 12:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584146, 808107, 19831, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen images before along this line, that are really utter crap. You''ve pulled this one off though, you''ve done it well, and it works. Nice job.</td>', 'I''ve seen images before along this line, that are really utter crap. You''ve pulled this one off though, you''ve done it well, and it works. Nice job.', '2009-07-23 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584150, 807178, 19831, '<td valign="top">Really nice job with the lighting. I like that you have enough for some detail on the dark side. Nice work.</td>', 'Really nice job with the lighting. I like that you have enough for some detail on the dark side. Nice work.', '2009-07-23 12:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584153, 808252, 19831, '<td valign="top">Well, you''ve gone and done everything just right. Stunning image.</td>', 'Well, you''ve gone and done everything just right. Stunning image.', '2009-07-23 12:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584157, 808056, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great environmental portrait, with added social commentary. Good job on exposure too. Nice job.</td>', 'Great environmental portrait, with added social commentary. Good job on exposure too. Nice job.', '2009-07-23 12:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584160, 807466, 19831, '<td valign="top">You must have worked hard on that crop. Very good composition! Very bold image. Quite striking. I like it! Nice job!</td>', 'You must have worked hard on that crop. Very good composition! Very bold image. Quite striking. I like it! Nice job!', '2009-07-23 12:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584163, 808203, 19831, '<td valign="top">There''s so much about this that just should be wrong, wrong, wrong, but somehow, for some reason, it makes me just really like it??? So...what can I say? Good job, I''m not sure why, but good job, really good job. :-)</td>', 'There''s so much about this that just should be wrong, wrong, wrong, but somehow, for some reason, it makes me just really like it??? So...what can I say? Good job, I''m not sure why, but good job, really good job. :-)', '2009-07-23 12:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584166, 808072, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject. Technically outstanding. Really nice work.</td>', 'Very cool subject. Technically outstanding. Really nice work.', '2009-07-23 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584171, 808303, 19831, '<td valign="top">Oh so daring and bold, especially for dpc. :-) But I think it''s rather cool. The concept works well. Great composition. Nice job!</td>', 'Oh so daring and bold, especially for dpc. :-) But I think it''s rather cool. The concept works well. Great composition. Nice job!', '2009-07-23 13:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584175, 808216, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I like it. Nice job!</td>', 'Very cool! I like it. Nice job!', '2009-07-23 13:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584179, 808227, 19831, '<td valign="top">Stunning image! Everything is just...just right. Excellant work!</td>', 'Stunning image! Everything is just...just right. Excellant work!', '2009-07-23 13:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584183, 808290, 19831, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image! Love the angle. Great composition. Awesome lighting. Nice work!</td>', 'Outstanding image! Love the angle. Great composition. Awesome lighting. Nice work!', '2009-07-23 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584206, 807634, 81618, '<td valign="top">Great impact shot, cant help but constantly looking in to those  eyes. Might work in a b&amp;W or a light sepia tone????</td>', 'Great impact shot, cant help but constantly looking in to those  eyes. Might work in a b&W or a light sepia tone????', '2009-07-23 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584208, 807844, 81618, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this really falls in to the portrait category. You see the faces and therefore cant build that relationship up between you and the subject.<br/> <br/>P.S. the Horizon isn''t straight!</td>', 'I don''t think this really falls in to the portrait category. You see the faces and therefore cant build that relationship up between you and the subject. P.S. the Horizon isn''t straight!', '2009-07-23 13:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584209, 808240, 81618, '<td valign="top">Nice grab shot of the ranger and it portrays him well. It tells us a story about him.</td>', 'Nice grab shot of the ranger and it portrays him well. It tells us a story about him.', '2009-07-23 13:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584213, 808203, 81618, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this shot. I would probably crop it in from the right though.</td>', 'Great idea for this shot. I would probably crop it in from the right though.', '2009-07-23 13:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584215, 808216, 81618, '<td valign="top">The top area of her chest is the lighest part in the photo so your eyes are drawn to that rather than the face of the model. I think the background may be too distracting.</td>', 'The top area of her chest is the lighest part in the photo so your eyes are drawn to that rather than the face of the model. I think the background may be too distracting.', '2009-07-23 13:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584217, 808345, 81618, '<td valign="top">nice shot, tells a story.</td>', 'nice shot, tells a story.', '2009-07-23 13:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584219, 807868, 81618, '<td valign="top">really nice job here. I find the peircing distracting though.</td>', 'really nice job here. I find the peircing distracting though.', '2009-07-23 13:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584223, 808208, 81618, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the Black Smith but I feel that he should either be concentrating on the job at hand or looking more directly at you. It seems to lack that connection with him and what he is doing. ALso that light in top right needs darkening down, cropping or cloning out.</td>', 'I like the idea of the Black Smith but I feel that he should either be concentrating on the job at hand or looking more directly at you. It seems to lack that connection with him and what he is doing. ALso that light in top right needs darkening down, cropping or cloning out.', '2009-07-23 13:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584224, 808210, 81618, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image here. love the rim lighting on her hair. Lovely blue eyes</td>', 'Nice simple image here. love the rim lighting on her hair. Lovely blue eyes', '2009-07-23 13:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584226, 808030, 81618, '<td valign="top">nice composition and it tells a story about the subject.</td>', 'nice composition and it tells a story about the subject.', '2009-07-23 13:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584230, 808190, 81618, '<td valign="top">nice lighting. Although the background is blurred once you see those bits sticking out you cant help looking at them</td>', 'nice lighting. Although the background is blurred once you see those bits sticking out you cant help looking at them', '2009-07-23 13:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584234, 808207, 81618, '<td valign="top">love the rim lighting on the model. The hat looks too small for her though and it feels like she ia suashed up agains the right hand side of the frame. A tighter crop may be?</td>', 'love the rim lighting on the model. The hat looks too small for her though and it feels like she ia suashed up agains the right hand side of the frame. A tighter crop may be?', '2009-07-23 13:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584236, 808028, 81618, '<td valign="top">nice shot, a good idea focusing on her artwork. Nice lighting as well.</td>', 'nice shot, a good idea focusing on her artwork. Nice lighting as well.', '2009-07-23 14:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584237, 808098, 81618, '<td valign="top">really nice shot. Nice and sharpe and the eyes stand out. Try recropping it to loose some of that space to the left to loose that light in the and to concentrate your eyes on the subject. A third should do it.</td>', 'really nice shot. Nice and sharpe and the eyes stand out. Try recropping it to loose some of that space to the left to loose that light in the and to concentrate your eyes on the subject. A third should do it.', '2009-07-23 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584239, 808285, 81618, '<td valign="top">great shot, Lots of detail. Tells a story . THat railing in the right hand corner needs sorting</td>', 'great shot, Lots of detail. Tells a story . THat railing in the right hand corner needs sorting', '2009-07-23 14:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584246, 808294, 105697, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, I''m sure those are not his biggest fans(pun, LOL!)!</td>', 'Very nice portrait, I''m sure those are not his biggest fans(pun, LOL!)!', '2009-07-23 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584247, 807178, 105697, '<td valign="top">Very nice, timeless! This will look just as nice in 50 years.</td>', 'Very nice, timeless! This will look just as nice in 50 years.', '2009-07-23 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584250, 808315, 105697, '<td valign="top">Wow, very effective! Lots of feeling. I really like the edginess.</td>', 'Wow, very effective! Lots of feeling. I really like the edginess.', '2009-07-23 14:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584252, 808179, 105697, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2009-07-23 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584253, 808152, 105697, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and timeless, too.</td>', 'Very nice, and timeless, too.', '2009-07-23 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584254, 807875, 105697, '<td valign="top">Whoa! While this would look wonderful in B&amp;W, I really like the colors atop and bottom of the weathered face.  Great photo, thanks!</td>', 'Whoa! While this would look wonderful in B&W, I really like the colors atop and bottom of the weathered face.  Great photo, thanks!', '2009-07-23 14:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584255, 808046, 81618, '<td valign="top">nice composition. I feel that the window is a bit to bright.</td>', 'nice composition. I feel that the window is a bit to bright.', '2009-07-23 14:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584256, 807697, 105697, '<td valign="top">I like the frankness of the photo! Really like the texture.</td>', 'I like the frankness of the photo! Really like the texture.', '2009-07-23 14:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584259, 807650, 105697, '<td valign="top">I like that her <i>lovely eyes </i>just grab you! Really fine photo!</td>', 'I like that her lovely eyes just grab you! Really fine photo!', '2009-07-23 14:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584261, 808252, 81618, '<td valign="top">Love the colours in this shot. lovely smile on the model and psoition in the frame is good. I would like to see that large white area just behind the models head darkening down</td>', 'Love the colours in this shot. lovely smile on the model and psoition in the frame is good. I would like to see that large white area just behind the models head darkening down', '2009-07-23 14:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584263, 807989, 81618, '<td valign="top">I really like the textured affect on this Shot. not sure about the whole blured affect though.</td>', 'I really like the textured affect on this Shot. not sure about the whole blured affect though.', '2009-07-23 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584266, 807859, 105697, '<td valign="top">Great photo, thanks!</td>', 'Great photo, thanks!', '2009-07-23 14:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584270, 807992, 81618, '<td valign="top">Very Nice shot indeed. I love the feel of this shot and the crispness of her eyes. I do think you need to either show more of the tattoos or less of them as the moment they are a bit distracting</td>', 'Very Nice shot indeed. I love the feel of this shot and the crispness of her eyes. I do think you need to either show more of the tattoos or less of them as the moment they are a bit distracting', '2009-07-23 14:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584277, 808176, 105697, '<td valign="top">This photo brought out many feelings recalled from my youth, from back in the 1970''s. I little lost, a bit disconnected, not being a child but not yet accepted as an adult, worry about my complection, desire for adventure, and not allowed the independence I wanted.<br/> <br/>Thanks for a great photo! I feel a lot of empathy for him.</td>', 'This photo brought out many feelings recalled from my youth, from back in the 1970''s. I little lost, a bit disconnected, not being a child but not yet accepted as an adult, worry about my complection, desire for adventure, and not allowed the independence I wanted. Thanks for a great photo! I feel a lot of empathy for him.', '2009-07-23 14:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584280, 807807, 81618, '<td valign="top">love the composition here.</td>', 'love the composition here.', '2009-07-23 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584283, 807466, 105697, '<td valign="top">I just love this! Great B&amp;W, texture, angle, composition!</td>', 'I just love this! Great B&W, texture, angle, composition!', '2009-07-23 14:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584287, 808180, 105697, '<td valign="top">Nice pic! Especially for a self-portrait. Thanks!</td>', 'Nice pic! Especially for a self-portrait. Thanks!', '2009-07-23 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584288, 808092, 81618, '<td valign="top">I love the overall composition of this shot and the colours. I don''t feel it offers a connection with the players though.</td>', 'I love the overall composition of this shot and the colours. I don''t feel it offers a connection with the players though.', '2009-07-23 14:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584290, 808268, 81618, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;w, it really suits the subject.</td>', 'Nice use of B&w, it really suits the subject.', '2009-07-23 14:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584294, 808100, 105697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes, lovely complection. Well captured in the photo, thanks!</td>', 'Beautiful eyes, lovely complection. Well captured in the photo, thanks!', '2009-07-23 14:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584296, 808318, 81618, '<td valign="top">great shot. Lovely textures just needs to that shadow under her chin sorting out.</td>', 'great shot. Lovely textures just needs to that shadow under her chin sorting out.', '2009-07-23 14:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
