(5585757, 808089, 51747, '<td valign="top">It is a good portrait. I feel that we are missing out on something because the eyes are the least emphasized part of this image.</td>', 'It is a good portrait. I feel that we are missing out on something because the eyes are the least emphasized part of this image.', '2009-07-24 21:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585758, 808281, 51747, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like Patrick Swayze.</td>', 'Looks a bit like Patrick Swayze.', '2009-07-24 21:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585759, 807974, 51747, '<td valign="top">Points for shock value.</td>', 'Points for shock value.', '2009-07-24 21:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585760, 807178, 51747, '<td valign="top">The lighting is real nice. The border isn''t helping at all IMHO</td>', 'The lighting is real nice. The border isn''t helping at all IMHO', '2009-07-24 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585761, 807651, 51747, '<td valign="top">A classic exposure. Well done.</td>', 'A classic exposure. Well done.', '2009-07-24 21:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585762, 808285, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like this more each time I look at it.</td>', 'I like this more each time I look at it.', '2009-07-24 21:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585763, 808063, 51747, '<td valign="top">Say whaaat? A little less smoke around the eyes and this would have been on the front page. Still in my top 10</td>', 'Say whaaat? A little less smoke around the eyes and this would have been on the front page. Still in my top 10', '2009-07-24 21:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585764, 807655, 51747, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and exposure but her expression could have been better.</td>', 'Great lighting and exposure but her expression could have been better.', '2009-07-24 21:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585765, 807887, 51747, '<td valign="top">You did  a good job with the exposure. Nice color BG and an overall pleasing portrait.</td>', 'You did  a good job with the exposure. Nice color BG and an overall pleasing portrait.', '2009-07-24 21:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585766, 808318, 51747, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful, no doubt. To me the image says more about the surroundings and not enough about her.</td>', 'She is beautiful, no doubt. To me the image says more about the surroundings and not enough about her.', '2009-07-24 21:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585768, 807995, 51747, '<td valign="top">She looks like a fun person to hang out with. I think you captured her very nicely. I''m not sure about the right half of the image though.</td>', 'She looks like a fun person to hang out with. I think you captured her very nicely. I''m not sure about the right half of the image though.', '2009-07-24 21:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585769, 808180, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like the high key.</td>', 'I like the high key.', '2009-07-24 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585770, 808178, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and exposure.</td>', 'Nice lighting and exposure.', '2009-07-24 21:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585771, 808217, 51747, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Really good exposure.</td>', 'Great shot! Really good exposure.', '2009-07-24 21:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585773, 808095, 51747, '<td valign="top">This is really well done. It''s one of my faves of the challenge.</td>', 'This is really well done. It''s one of my faves of the challenge.', '2009-07-24 21:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585776, 808204, 51747, '<td valign="top">A superb portrait. Top marks!</td>', 'A superb portrait. Top marks!', '2009-07-24 21:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585777, 808303, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic feel and the lensbaby adds some mystery to the subject.</td>', 'Nice graphic feel and the lensbaby adds some mystery to the subject.', '2009-07-24 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585778, 807744, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2009-07-24 21:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585779, 808138, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very emotive. Certainly a sense of anguish here.</td>', 'Very emotive. Certainly a sense of anguish here.', '2009-07-24 21:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585782, 807875, 51747, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty amazing. Has lot''s going for it. Good colors, good exposure, good model. A feeling of the exotic. Hard to beat this one.</td>', 'It''s pretty amazing. Has lot''s going for it. Good colors, good exposure, good model. A feeling of the exotic. Hard to beat this one.', '2009-07-24 22:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585784, 808320, 51747, '<td valign="top">Yes she is and I keep getting closer to my monitor because I want to see her better!</td>', 'Yes she is and I keep getting closer to my monitor because I want to see her better!', '2009-07-24 22:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585786, 807697, 51747, '<td valign="top">This is really good but it''s an ''almost perfect'' shot. Maybe a tighter crop would have helped. I still score this a 7 but it could have been higher.</td>', 'This is really good but it''s an ''almost perfect'' shot. Maybe a tighter crop would have helped. I still score this a 7 but it could have been higher.', '2009-07-24 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585790, 807625, 51747, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat use of color. A nice portrait.</td>', 'Pretty neat use of color. A nice portrait.', '2009-07-24 22:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585791, 807855, 51747, '<td valign="top">I can sense women all over the world cringing at the sight of that dress being in the ocean. Nice shot of this couple.</td>', 'I can sense women all over the world cringing at the sight of that dress being in the ocean. Nice shot of this couple.', '2009-07-24 22:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585792, 807972, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea for this challenge. Refreshingly effective.</td>', 'Very unique idea for this challenge. Refreshingly effective.', '2009-07-24 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585793, 807818, 51747, '<td valign="top">I think you were lucky to have such a beautiful model.</td>', 'I think you were lucky to have such a beautiful model.', '2009-07-24 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5585859, 807536, 40775, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2009-07-25 00:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586064, 808171, 56452, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the personality.   Only one problem,  if she was really working that dough, her hands would be covered in flour, they''re too clean.  <br/> <br/>But I still think it''s a good pic.</td>', 'Great capture of the personality.   Only one problem,  if she was really working that dough, her hands would be covered in flour, they''re too clean.   But I still think it''s a good pic.', '2009-07-25 11:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586066, 807627, 56452, '<td valign="top">Really marvelous warm lighting. Her eyes are outstanding.    A little standard, on the pose, but really nice,   good job.</td>', 'Really marvelous warm lighting. Her eyes are outstanding.    A little standard, on the pose, but really nice,   good job.', '2009-07-25 11:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586069, 808180, 56452, '<td valign="top">Very good on the hi-key, great expression, and the eyes are dead on.     I think I might prefer the visible shoulder be bare, but that''s a very minor issue.   keep up the good work.</td>', 'Very good on the hi-key, great expression, and the eyes are dead on.     I think I might prefer the visible shoulder be bare, but that''s a very minor issue.   keep up the good work.', '2009-07-25 11:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586070, 807818, 56452, '<td valign="top">What wonderful character reflected in this pic.  You can see all the experience, good and bad in this woman''s life.  Her eyes are as bright and full of life as ever.   Good job on the lighting.   Keep it up!</td>', 'What wonderful character reflected in this pic.  You can see all the experience, good and bad in this woman''s life.  Her eyes are as bright and full of life as ever.   Good job on the lighting.   Keep it up!', '2009-07-25 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586072, 808289, 56452, '<td valign="top">I like.    Nice lighting that plays up her features. Her smile is genuine and the eyes are bright.   The combination of lighting and angle minimize what some might think is a large nose (that''s a statement, not a put down),   good job.   Keep it up.</td>', 'I like.    Nice lighting that plays up her features. Her smile is genuine and the eyes are bright.   The combination of lighting and angle minimize what some might think is a large nose (that''s a statement, not a put down),   good job.   Keep it up.', '2009-07-25 11:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586075, 808072, 56452, '<td valign="top">WOW!       great job</td>', 'WOW!       great job', '2009-07-25 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586076, 808276, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice, especially for the newlyweds.   I would criticize the shine on her shoulder, but this definitely a candid as opposed to posed.   Her eyes are great and the contact between the 2 is spot on.   Great memory for the couple and good job.</td>', 'Nice, especially for the newlyweds.   I would criticize the shine on her shoulder, but this definitely a candid as opposed to posed.   Her eyes are great and the contact between the 2 is spot on.   Great memory for the couple and good job.', '2009-07-25 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586077, 808171, 105938, '<td valign="top">Sweet</td>', 'Sweet', '2009-07-25 11:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586079, 808095, 56452, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.   I can''t really say anything is wrong with it.   Personally, I would have cropped it to about a  2x6 ratio with the bride filling the frame,   that''s just me.   Nice capture.</td>', 'I like this idea.   I can''t really say anything is wrong with it.   Personally, I would have cropped it to about a  2x6 ratio with the bride filling the frame,   that''s just me.   Nice capture.', '2009-07-25 11:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586081, 808313, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice.     Great composition,  the lines of the tracks lead into the distance and minimize her hips.  Great expression too,   I hope you get paid for this cause it''s a good job.</td>', 'Nice.     Great composition,  the lines of the tracks lead into the distance and minimize her hips.  Great expression too,   I hope you get paid for this cause it''s a good job.', '2009-07-25 11:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586084, 807462, 56452, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Character.</td>', 'Wonderful Character.', '2009-07-25 11:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586085, 807799, 56452, '<td valign="top">Good portrait, but the title doesn''t seem to match the personality depicted.</td>', 'Good portrait, but the title doesn''t seem to match the personality depicted.', '2009-07-25 11:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586089, 808176, 56452, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a picture that captures personality.  Great catchlights in the eyes, good lighting and expression.     This aint just a picture,  it''s a portrait.   Keep on</td>', 'Now there''s a picture that captures personality.  Great catchlights in the eyes, good lighting and expression.     This aint just a picture,  it''s a portrait.   Keep on', '2009-07-25 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586090, 808265, 56452, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about good, bad or otherwise, but I could just fall into those eyes!</td>', 'I don''t know about good, bad or otherwise, but I could just fall into those eyes!', '2009-07-25 11:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586091, 807992, 56452, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed.   I love the color of tats in conjunction with the hat.   And her eyes just blow you away.   Great even lighting on the skin.   I really like this on.</td>', 'Very nice indeed.   I love the color of tats in conjunction with the hat.   And her eyes just blow you away.   Great even lighting on the skin.   I really like this on.', '2009-07-25 11:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586093, 808294, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, if you really want to show how hot it was, slow down the shutter speed.</td>', 'Nice capture, if you really want to show how hot it was, slow down the shutter speed.', '2009-07-25 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586094, 808127, 56452, '<td valign="top">Father and son?    I can''t tell the relationship, but it''s a great shot.     I wish the younger one''s eyes were open.</td>', 'Father and son?    I can''t tell the relationship, but it''s a great shot.     I wish the younger one''s eyes were open.', '2009-07-25 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586095, 807536, 56452, '<td valign="top">Very sexy,   Great even lighting</td>', 'Very sexy,   Great even lighting', '2009-07-25 11:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586096, 808153, 56452, '<td valign="top">The natural light from the left and behind is pleasing.   The artificial light from the right is almost overpowering.   I think you are trying to balance it out, not over power.    The Fix?  I would Crop in so the blown out porch rail doesn''t show. Her skin looks great on that side.</td>', 'The natural light from the left and behind is pleasing.   The artificial light from the right is almost overpowering.   I think you are trying to balance it out, not over power.    The Fix?  I would Crop in so the blown out porch rail doesn''t show. Her skin looks great on that side.', '2009-07-25 12:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586098, 808089, 56452, '<td valign="top">Wow,  you can see the wheels in his brain turning.   The personality really comes thru and the eyes looking out of frame really make the whole thing work.</td>', 'Wow,  you can see the wheels in his brain turning.   The personality really comes thru and the eyes looking out of frame really make the whole thing work.', '2009-07-25 12:03:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5586099, 807681, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a little bit out there.   Try smaller jewels on the face next time.</td>', 'Nice, but a little bit out there.   Try smaller jewels on the face next time.', '2009-07-25 12:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586100, 808202, 56452, '<td valign="top">A little too much light from the right side of the frame.    Otherwise, very nice portrait.</td>', 'A little too much light from the right side of the frame.    Otherwise, very nice portrait.', '2009-07-25 12:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586106, 807655, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice job.    The catch lights in her eyes are almost too consistent to be natural.  If there are three light head close together it''s one thing.   If not, try again.   Her lips and skin are spot on though.  Try a softbox instead of a bare lighthead.</td>', 'Nice job.    The catch lights in her eyes are almost too consistent to be natural.  If there are three light head close together it''s one thing.   If not, try again.   Her lips and skin are spot on though.  Try a softbox instead of a bare lighthead.', '2009-07-25 12:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586108, 807624, 56452, '<td valign="top">I love that natural personality showing through here.   Only thing I would change would be to add a reflector on the left side of the frame to decrease the shadows on that side.</td>', 'I love that natural personality showing through here.   Only thing I would change would be to add a reflector on the left side of the frame to decrease the shadows on that side.', '2009-07-25 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586109, 808207, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice glamour type shot.    Her eye direction is off,  needs to be towards the camera or level going out of frame.   Looking up just doesn''t seem natural in this case.</td>', 'Nice glamour type shot.    Her eye direction is off,  needs to be towards the camera or level going out of frame.   Looking up just doesn''t seem natural in this case.', '2009-07-25 12:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586110, 808199, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, good pose, good lighting.   The sepia doesn''t work for me though,   have you tried a straight black/white conversion?   I think it might be really great.</td>', 'Nice pic, good pose, good lighting.   The sepia doesn''t work for me though,   have you tried a straight black/white conversion?   I think it might be really great.', '2009-07-25 12:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586111, 808274, 56452, '<td valign="top">I don''t exactly know what to say about this pic,   but it WORKS!      Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I don''t exactly know what to say about this pic,   but it WORKS!      Keep up the good work.', '2009-07-25 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586112, 808248, 56452, '<td valign="top">Very good hi-key.   A little extreme perhaps, but well done.</td>', 'Very good hi-key.   A little extreme perhaps, but well done.', '2009-07-25 12:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586113, 808318, 56452, '<td valign="top">Very Hollywood.   I like what your did.   One inconsistency,  If she is the Sun Goddess, why are the brooms brown instead of golden?    That''s splitting hairs, don''t worry, nice job.</td>', 'Very Hollywood.   I like what your did.   One inconsistency,  If she is the Sun Goddess, why are the brooms brown instead of golden?    That''s splitting hairs, don''t worry, nice job.', '2009-07-25 12:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586115, 808193, 56452, '<td valign="top">Love the freckles.  Very expressive capture of the personality.</td>', 'Love the freckles.  Very expressive capture of the personality.', '2009-07-25 12:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586116, 807625, 56452, '<td valign="top">I bet this was a fun shoot.    Love the smile and her eyes are smiling too.</td>', 'I bet this was a fun shoot.    Love the smile and her eyes are smiling too.', '2009-07-25 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586117, 808277, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice relationship shot.   I think I would prefer to zoom in and fill the frame with the couple, and or perhaps use this as a background for a close up of the faces.  Still very nice.</td>', 'Nice relationship shot.   I think I would prefer to zoom in and fill the frame with the couple, and or perhaps use this as a background for a close up of the faces.  Still very nice.', '2009-07-25 12:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586118, 807941, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice, Sexy,   Good lighting and pose.    Keep it up</td>', 'Nice, Sexy,   Good lighting and pose.    Keep it up', '2009-07-25 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586119, 807972, 56452, '<td valign="top">Give me just a bit more differentiation between her skin and the background,  or perhaps a black/white conversion.   Great eyes.</td>', 'Give me just a bit more differentiation between her skin and the background,  or perhaps a black/white conversion.   Great eyes.', '2009-07-25 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586122, 807988, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice action,  How many shots did it take.   Great effort,  I hope you are rewarded.</td>', 'Nice action,  How many shots did it take.   Great effort,  I hope you are rewarded.', '2009-07-25 12:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586123, 808204, 56452, '<td valign="top">I really like this, it works.</td>', 'I really like this, it works.', '2009-07-25 12:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586185, 808274, 100318, '<td valign="top">Great subject</td>', 'Great subject', '2009-07-25 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586189, 807818, 100318, '<td valign="top">It conveys so much happiness.</td>', 'It conveys so much happiness.', '2009-07-25 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586338, 807765, 108890, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! My top choice by far. I love the way you utilized the water and fabric. Great job!</td>', 'This is fantastic! My top choice by far. I love the way you utilized the water and fabric. Great job!', '2009-07-25 20:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586339, 808091, 108890, '<td valign="top">I really like her posture in the photo!</td>', 'I really like her posture in the photo!', '2009-07-25 20:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586340, 807646, 108890, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Her blue eyes almost pop off the page.</td>', 'Great shot! Her blue eyes almost pop off the page.', '2009-07-25 20:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586341, 808110, 108890, '<td valign="top">Love the lines in this photo!</td>', 'Love the lines in this photo!', '2009-07-25 20:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586352, 808058, 95208, '<td valign="top">Nicely done eyes; very nice shot and editing.</td>', 'Nicely done eyes; very nice shot and editing.', '2009-07-25 20:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586353, 808153, 54228, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter around this one for me. It''s a lovely shot of her, but the background and her surrounds could use some work.</td>', 'Too much clutter around this one for me. It''s a lovely shot of her, but the background and her surrounds could use some work.', '2009-07-25 20:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586354, 807681, 54228, '<td valign="top">A very interesting concept. However, for a shot like this to work, one needs really edgy lighting.</td>', 'A very interesting concept. However, for a shot like this to work, one needs really edgy lighting.', '2009-07-25 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586355, 807646, 54228, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, and your composition is quite good, but i think you went a little too far on her eyes.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, and your composition is quite good, but i think you went a little too far on her eyes.', '2009-07-25 20:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586447, 807974, 98171, '<td valign="top">scary</td>', 'scary', '2009-07-26 00:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
