couple of other cars .. check them out .. i was thinking of you when we were there and the great shots you take .. i got a real blast taking the photographs especially coz my brother was racing .. i''d love to do some dirt track shots now .. more exciting .. !!! ..:)', '2009-07-27 06:26:45.000000', '2009-07-27 06:28:01.000000', 0),
