(5587675, 808274, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great character!  He looks awesome in B&amp;W, too.  I think this is a very well done environmental type portrait - I love the way his hat creates a grid on his face, too.  My only nit is the shallow DOF combined with his hairy arms and underlying tattoos make his arms look like they''re growing something... :-)  Still, very cool shot of a very cool guy - glad you asked him!  If you get a chance to run into him again, I''m sure he''d love a copy of this.</td>', 'What a great character!  He looks awesome in B&W, too.  I think this is a very well done environmental type portrait - I love the way his hat creates a grid on his face, too.  My only nit is the shallow DOF combined with his hairy arms and underlying tattoos make his arms look like they''re growing something... :-)  Still, very cool shot of a very cool guy - glad you asked him!  If you get a chance to run into him again, I''m sure he''d love a copy of this.', '2009-07-27 09:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587678, 808028, 30982, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful girl and such an unusual thing to have tattoed on such a beautiful girl.  I, too, would like a bit more of her face - at least a hint of an eye, maybe.  But good job with this - unusual and nicely done.</td>', 'Such a beautiful girl and such an unusual thing to have tattoed on such a beautiful girl.  I, too, would like a bit more of her face - at least a hint of an eye, maybe.  But good job with this - unusual and nicely done.', '2009-07-27 09:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587681, 808322, 30982, '<td valign="top">The things your husband will do for you, I swear.... He makes such a cute Cowardly Lion, too.  :-)  Got a 6 from me for the stark raving madness of it all.  Gotta ask - where did you get the awesome Dorothy (and Toto) cutout?</td>', 'The things your husband will do for you, I swear.... He makes such a cute Cowardly Lion, too.  :-)  Got a 6 from me for the stark raving madness of it all.  Gotta ask - where did you get the awesome Dorothy (and Toto) cutout?', '2009-07-27 09:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587683, 808216, 30982, '<td valign="top">This was a high vote getter from me.  I like it in B&amp;W - one can "see" the blue sky without the color (OK, I can anyway), and I like the angle, the framing, the slight looking down at us, and her gentle bemused smile.</td>', 'This was a high vote getter from me.  I like it in B&W - one can "see" the blue sky without the color (OK, I can anyway), and I like the angle, the framing, the slight looking down at us, and her gentle bemused smile.', '2009-07-27 09:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587684, 807807, 30982, '<td valign="top">I should have recognized you!  But oddly, I didn''t.  Got a 9 from me - love the fun of it, the contrast of it, the whimsy of it, the angle of it.  Just really well done - great job!  (WOEFULLY underappreciated, by the way - just noticed the score.  Sad, sad, sad.  Except of course for your brilliant commenters.)</td>', 'I should have recognized you!  But oddly, I didn''t.  Got a 9 from me - love the fun of it, the contrast of it, the whimsy of it, the angle of it.  Just really well done - great job!  (WOEFULLY underappreciated, by the way - just noticed the score.  Sad, sad, sad.  Except of course for your brilliant commenters.)', '2009-07-27 09:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587687, 808260, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this is perfectly lovely, Julianne - there''s a gentleness, a tenderness to this, and I''ll bet that reflects her personality well.  Glad she likes it!</td>', 'I think this is perfectly lovely, Julianne - there''s a gentleness, a tenderness to this, and I''ll bet that reflects her personality well.  Glad she likes it!', '2009-07-27 09:28:10.000000', NULL, 0),
