(5587696, 808127, 30982, '<td valign="top">I still stand by the "very fun" aspect of it.  :-)  And yes, good processing for what looks like rather nasty light to shoot in.  More about the meaning than the technicals in any case.</td>', 'I still stand by the "very fun" aspect of it.  :-)  And yes, good processing for what looks like rather nasty light to shoot in.  More about the meaning than the technicals in any case.', '2009-07-27 09:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587699, 808134, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hi Peter!  I thought that was you.  Still trying to figure what you''re working on here - I know you''ve had shelving projects going.  And it looks as though you have very good quality tools - my brother and my nephews would be quite envious.  I quite like how the lamp behind you has burned a sun into the wall.</td>', 'Hi Peter!  I thought that was you.  Still trying to figure what you''re working on here - I know you''ve had shelving projects going.  And it looks as though you have very good quality tools - my brother and my nephews would be quite envious.  I quite like how the lamp behind you has burned a sun into the wall.', '2009-07-27 09:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587700, 808199, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the setting for this shoot - provides a nice mix of tones and textures.  The highlights on her tummy are just a tad high on this monitor (which tends to run a bit high) but otherwise the exposure is good, the pose is good.  Are you going to post more from this shoot?  And I agree that I''d like to see it in B&amp;W, though I do like the toning in this one.</td>', 'Love the setting for this shoot - provides a nice mix of tones and textures.  The highlights on her tummy are just a tad high on this monitor (which tends to run a bit high) but otherwise the exposure is good, the pose is good.  Are you going to post more from this shoot?  And I agree that I''d like to see it in B&W, though I do like the toning in this one.', '2009-07-27 09:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5587703, 807757, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very real shot of a real person - and interesting to see someone of "his age" with an earring, though I''m not sure why - he''s my generation more or less and guys in my generation have pierced ears....  I think he reminds me that I''m getting old.</td>', 'A very real shot of a real person - and interesting to see someone of "his age" with an earring, though I''m not sure why - he''s my generation more or less and guys in my generation have pierced ears....  I think he reminds me that I''m getting old.', '2009-07-27 09:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
