(5591714, 807178, 65858, '<td valign="top">Man, a red laser would have made us twins!  =D<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=619895" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/780/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_619895.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/780/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_619895.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/780/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_619895.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I really like your lighting.  Nice!</td>', 'Man, a red laser would have made us twins!  =D   I really like your lighting.  Nice!', '2009-07-30 14:12:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5592464, 807875, 3936, '<td valign="top">This is an amazingly great imnage.  This is just about everything I wish I could accomplish with my photography.<br/> <br/>The sharpness, the color, the depth of the tones, not to mention you seemed to have captures a lot of the spirit of this man.<br/> <br/>He may have been a bit shy, but his gaze into the lens is firm and sure.  Very well lit, and absolutely deserving of the blue.  <br/> <br/>Congratulations on an outstanding image.</td>', 'This is an amazingly great imnage.  This is just about everything I wish I could accomplish with my photography. The sharpness, the color, the depth of the tones, not to mention you seemed to have captures a lot of the spirit of this man. He may have been a bit shy, but his gaze into the lens is firm and sure.  Very well lit, and absolutely deserving of the blue.   Congratulations on an outstanding image.', '2009-07-31 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
