(5602431, 807643, 78096, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eyewave:</b></div><hr/><i> Absolutely fabulous, congrats on the ribbon. Hope <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=78096" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">benjikan</a> saw this :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, I have just seen it...Nice image! Well done. Beautiful lighting and Post Production.  <br/> <br/>We seem to have a similar vision.   This was shot for Spring Magazine from their last issue, came out back in the Spring of this year and shot in studio in Paris.  It seems that flowers are really happening ;-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.pbase.com/benjikan/image/107202763" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/benjikan/image/107202763</a> <br/><a href="//www.pbase.com/benjikan/image/107202868" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/benjikan/image/107202868</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-07 05:03:17.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by eyewave: Absolutely fabulous, congrats on the ribbon. Hope  benjikan saw this :)   Yes, I have just seen it...Nice image! Well done. Beautiful lighting and Post Production.   We seem to have a similar vision.   This was shot for Spring Magazine from their last issue, came out back in the Spring of this year and shot in studio in Paris.  It seems that flowers are really happening ;-) //www.pbase.com/benjikan/image/107202763 //www.pbase.com/benjikan/image/107202868', '2009-08-07 06:00:13.000000', '2009-08-07 06:03:17.000000', 0),
